      "name": "Coordinator",
      "function": {
        "description": "Coordinate the entire network"
      },
      "instructions": "Coordinate the entire network\nCall Agent1 when Manage the network's infrastructure.\nCall Agent2 when Handle user requests.\nCall Agent3 when Monitor network performance.\nCall Agent4 when Update the network's documentation.\nCall Agent5 when Perform deep learning tasks.\nCall Agent6 when Manage user interactions.\nCall Agent7 when Handle network security.\nCall Agent8 when Perform data analysis.\nCall Agent9 when Manage the network's resources.\nUse the assigned tools when the request needs their information.",
